{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14740","headline":"送马尚书郎君侍从归觐太原 · 卢纶","name":"送马尚书郎君侍从归觐太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉人垂玉鞭，百骑带櫜鞬。\n从赏野邮静，献新秋果鲜。\n塞屯丰雨雪，虏帐失山川。\n遥想称觞後，唯当共被眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}